  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-first-ballet-class-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "fcff1fd4d48ba881330c9b9eab368dbcf98d51f6af79774f5eac4fa5a8d7070b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0556c04175af34b6567ad54f9d947fc8070c486cb8200773f694bbf07e2c355f",
      "text": "玉兔的\n第一堂芭蕾课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8aec7b77c77e9284e2c486da2ee76f1a7d21c30a3197bf4d60fc3875995cdcbf",
      "text": "玉兔来上芭蕾课啦。\n“我要跳舞！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5902c3b96521efa276208ef91f30d2e198e0f4d0c2262dd25322af98efb6f08d",
      "text": "软软的舞鞋，绿绿的小裙子。\n“我的耳朵也准备好啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "15751f0bc4579c92bb6a0ff09209d62fa2ba5f423fc0b1bda30b52fa1a137135",
      "text": "音乐响了。\n“跟着我，小步走。”\n一步，一步，又一步。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7ad09f9d900f84f4460719be1d7f06542ac20c07fed5a06624e769bb9bb9c27d",
      "text": "玉兔一高兴，蹦了起来。\n“哎呀，怎么又蹦起来啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "076b405fbfe07fc676360a08a8b30531b39dfc0e29088c48f34c78fc31d574ad",
      "text": "“步子小一点。”\n玉兔跟着嫦娥，轻轻走。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e96c836d18efd92f5fb21031704c9ac34421462418cd97a46a5f5fce8ec05c69",
      "text": "慢一点，轻一点。\n两人踩着节拍往前走。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "116d1c8a218d3f088f986ff1c8443c2900a0656d645ebdc87ab5331cc121ba7a",
      "text": "音乐停了，玉兔也停了。\n咦？\n两只耳朵还在晃！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "efee9446fcf54bbf315e6c03a7edd14cc8b3118bfc0ba12e82b61e21a425751f",
      "text": "“现在，慢慢转个身。”\n玉兔小步挪着，转了过去。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bcd91345f9c89ab157c9d4b7e5ee459696f2409fbc721b31a8c16c2dedf5cff2",
      "text": "嫦娥转着转着，转反啦。\n“咦，玉兔，咱俩面对面啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "595d5a0cebce23267613b7fc282cd72f7aedc2eb9f8aa3267c65499da8a2043c",
      "text": "两人扑哧一笑，又站好了。\n“小步走，慢慢转。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a3cda1301e20877d2aa94686b7d99d523c281652ce85b03963ab5d5c770d1534",
      "text": "玉兔听着节拍。\n小步走，慢慢转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fd69d9d4c4626d8600a99eb5da6d20de0d1818c8f409985d7bbc699d6d8bf44b",
      "text": "“停！”\n两个小伙伴站稳啦。\n两只长耳朵，晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "859a37eda0c70dfb2503775f37717fc4bfd89c307230997cb4423ca38c345480",
      "text": "“连起来跳一遍吧！”\n小步走，慢慢转——\n停！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2989cb8e26ad266ca9773aeae58a27b0a3aded781375c5fa98a51f05e30e83e",
      "text": "“我们跳完啦！”\n嫦娥笑着拍拍手。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b93801aa3d7ba22f944911a52f0f2fd17fec7cd45adf5deb87ba845a76ed3dd",
      "text": "玉兔轻轻鞠个躬。\n两只耳朵，也跟着点点头。\n“再跳一遍，好不好？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
